==First round==
A total of 70 teams played in the first round: the two winners from the preliminary round, the remaining 20 from [[EFL League Two|League Two]] (tier 4), 24 from [[EFL League One|League One]] (tier 3), and 24 from the [[EFL Championship|Championship]] (tier 2). The draw for this round was split on a geographical basis into northern and southern sections, where teams were drawn against a team from the same section. The draw was held on 25 June 2026, hosted by Dharmesh Sheth and performed by [[Kevin Nolan]] and [[Luke Chambers]].<ref name="Round_One">{{cite news |url=https://www.efl.com/news/2026/june/25/carabao-cup-round-one-draw-confirmed/ |title=Carabao Cup Round One draw confirmed |publisher=English Football League |date=25 June 2026 |access-date=27 June 2026}}</ref><ref>{{cite news |author=Hodgson, George |title=Carabao Cup first round draw in FULL: Preston North End just miss Blackpool and get Huddersfield Town |url=https://www.lep.co.uk/sport/football/preston-north-end/carabao-cup-draw-first-round-one-updates-news-preston-north-end-vs-huddersfield-town-8761519 |work=Lancashire Post |publisher=Iconic Media |date=25 June 2026 |access-date=20 September 2026}}</ref>

